 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports of computers in 2008 totaled 4.90 billion euros.",
  "The largest export destination was France, receiving 858.5 million euros or 17.5% of the total.",
  "Italy and Spain followed as the second and third largest destinations with 570.1 million euros and 540.6 million euros respectively.",
  "The top three export countries together accounted for 40.2% of total computer exports.",
  "Note that 1.6% of exports went to undisclosed partners and values are nominal euros, not adjusted for price changes."
 ],
